{"words": [{"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "Or"}, {"text": "تَقُولُوٓا۟", "translation": "you say"}, {"text": "إِنَّمَآ", "translation": "Only"}, {"text": "أَشْرَكَ", "translation": "partners (were) associated (with Allah)"}, {"text": "ءَابَآؤُنَا", "translation": "(by) our forefathers"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قَبْلُ", "translation": "before (us)"}, {"text": "وَكُنَّا", "translation": "and we are"}, {"text": "ذُرِّيَّةًۭ", "translation": "descendants"}, {"text": "مِّنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِهِمْ ۖ", "translation": "after them"}, {"text": "أَفَتُهْلِكُنَا", "translation": "So will You destroy us"}, {"text": "بِمَا", "translation": "for what"}, {"text": "فَعَلَ", "translation": "did"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ", "translation": "the falsifiers"}], "sahih": "Or [lest] you say, \"It was only that our fathers associated [others in worship] with Allāh before, and we were but descendants after them. Then would You destroy us for what the falsifiers have done?\""}